{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CCF9DU2tt6WGPy2zj8WiJZ","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 4d5e043c535d36f2e1298ea00bfaf2c1b0f125ce\nAuthor: Federico Scheu <fscheu@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue May 12 17:56:38 2026 +0000\n\n    feat(QuantAgent-69d): add LLM token/time telemetry tracking\n    \n    - New quantagent/llm_telemetry.py with TelemetryCtx dataclass,\n      extract_usage() (LangChain usage_metadata + OpenAI legacy shapes),\n      persist_llm_call() (best-effort Log row, event_type='llm_call'),\n      and get_session_metrics() / get_backtest_metrics() aggregation helpers.\n    - Extended invoke_with_retry() with optional telemetry_ctx parameter;\n      persists one Log row on success and on final/non-retryable failure\n      with duration_ms measured via perf_counter.\n    - Wired TelemetryCtx into indicator_agent, pattern_agent, trend_agent,\n      and decision_agent nodes using state-available context fields\n      (symbol, thread_id, environment, backtest_run_id).\n    \n    No migrations required; uses existing Log model.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n quantagent/agent_utils.py     |  39 +++++++-\n quantagent/decision_agent.py  |  12 ++-\n quantagent/indicator_agent.py |  12 ++-\n quantagent/llm_telemetry.py   | 228 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n quantagent/pattern_agent.py   |  15 ++-\n quantagent/trend_agent.py     |  15 ++-\n 6 files changed, 313 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6027cba3-e69d-464f-aa78-e9e9792aa2ae","uuid":"e3692197-92e9-4e72-af0d-bc1ab102b7c6","timestamp":"2026-05-12T17:58:43.064Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit 4d5e043c535d36f2e1298ea00bfaf2c1b0f125ce\nAuthor: Federico Scheu <fscheu@gmail.com>\nDate:   Tue May 12 17:56:38 2026 +0000\n\n    feat(QuantAgent-69d): add LLM token/time telemetry tracking\n    \n    - New quantagent/llm_telemetry.py with TelemetryCtx dataclass,\n      extract_usage() (LangChain usage_metadata + OpenAI legacy shapes),\n      persist_llm_call() (best-effort Log row, event_type='llm_call'),\n      and get_session_metrics() / get_backtest_metrics() aggregation helpers.\n    - Extended invoke_with_retry() with optional telemetry_ctx parameter;\n      persists one Log row on success and on final/non-retryable failure\n      with duration_ms measured via perf_counter.\n    - Wired TelemetryCtx into indicator_agent, pattern_agent, trend_agent,\n      and decision_agent nodes using state-available context fields\n      (symbol, thread_id, environment, backtest_run_id).\n    \n    No migrations required; uses existing Log model.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n quantagent/agent_utils.py     |  39 +++++++-\n quantagent/decision_agent.py  |  12 ++-\n quantagent/indicator_agent.py |  12 ++-\n quantagent/llm_telemetry.py   | 228 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n quantagent/pattern_agent.py   |  15 ++-\n quantagent/trend_agent.py     |  15 ++-\n 6 files changed, 313 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
